<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44298" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐκρᾱής</span></b> , 
			Ep.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐϋκρ-</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὔκρᾱτος</span>
			 (
				v.l. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκραής</span>
			 in <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				14.299
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Op.</u>
				594
			</span></i>); of winds, <i>gentle</i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				2.1228
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				4.891
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀὴρ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thphr.
					<u>CP</u>
					1.11.6
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				2.3.3
			</span></i> (nisi leg. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐκράς</span>);
				<i>temperate</i>, neither too dry nor too wet, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τόποι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Mete.</u>
					352a7
				</span></i>
			; of love, <i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>H.</u>
				4.33
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐκράς</span>
			 (A) <i><span class="en">
				2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				6.23
			</span></i> (interpol.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			Adv. -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αῶς</span> prob. cj. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐκραής</span> in <i><span class="en">
				Aristaenet.
				1.3
			</span></i>.</div>
